    "text": {
     "en": "Infrastructure means basic facilities such as roads, railways, ports, airports, electricity, water and communication networks.\nPorts like Mumbai, Chennai and Kolkata handle most of India's foreign trade by sea. Airports connect cities quickly. Mobile and internet networks link people across the country.\nGood infrastructure helps farmers sell crops and industries grow."
